{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E700/E749_002.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MND_000_0_1#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Ann and I roamed the[n]snowy Shibuya streets[n]for quite some time...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...No matter where you look,[n]it's all couples.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Ugh, I really messed up... I thought[n]we'd be able to eat somewhere[n]without a reservation.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_5_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "And this was supposed to be our chance[n]to spend Christmas Eve together...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "The city's sure different.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm hungry.",
   "uk": "Я голодний.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You're all I need.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Yeah, I totally underestimated[n]the holiday atmosphere...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Let's try and be a little more[n]romantic, okay?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Oh, you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "So... what are we supposed to do for[n]Christmas Eve?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Go out? Eat dinner together? If we were[n]both adults... get drunk together?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#2",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I just don't know.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's liven things up.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_007_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm not really sure.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_007_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "The night's still young.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Great idea!",
   "uk": "Чудова ідея!",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Yeah... What do other people do...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "You sound like a sleazy old man!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_010_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I won't be able to see Ann[n]again after tomorrow...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_010_5_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We spent a long time talking...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Oh yeah, I got you something.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Surprise!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "You totally weren't expecting that,[n]now were you?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Not at all.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_013_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Honestly, I was.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "*giggle* Take good care of it.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "You know me so well...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Hey, I know this is sudden...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "But the whole Shido incident has been[n]on the news every day, right?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I'm a little worried...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "If the police find out about[n]the Phantom Thieves...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "It's not that I'm afraid of getting caught.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_5_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I lie awake at night thinking about what[n]I'd do if I couldn't see you anymore...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "If that happens, there's no telling what[n]they'll do to you or your teammates.",
   "uk": "Якщо так станеться, хтозна, що вони[n]зроблять із тобою чи твоїми[n]товаришами.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "There's even the possibility that they'll[n]fabricate a crime and move to arrest[n]you all.",
   "uk": "Можливо навіть, що вони сфабрикують[n]злочин і візьмуться[n]заарештувати вас усіх.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I have to turn myself in to[n]make sure Ann stays safe...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "But telling her about it would[n]only cause her to panic...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...What's wrong?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's nothing.",
   "uk": "Нічого.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm sorry.",
   "uk": "Вибачте.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Hm? For what?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "......",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Sorry, I'm really ruining the mood...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...I think I'm just gonna go home.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll walk you back.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_025_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Be careful.",
   "uk": "Будь обережний.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "No, I'll be okay.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Yeah.",
   "uk": "...Так.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_029_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...You're hiding something from me...[n]aren't you?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I wish you had just told me...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Good night.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_031_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I made Ann worry...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_031_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Even so, this is the only way...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}